Range Mean 

Density [cm-3] 2.4 - 81.0 29.3 6.7 2.93 

Dynamic Pressure [nPa] 1.4 - 57.2 10.5 2.3 4.57 

Temperature [105 K] 0.97 - 26.35 4.91 1.02 4.81 

Magnetic field [nT] 4.6 - 44.9 14.8 5.5 2.69 

